  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kuteteza (HIV prevention)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Kuteteza Health project is to expand access to high quality biomedical interventions that will avert new HIV infections among young boys and men and their respective partners, and support HIV risk reduction activities at the community level. USAID intends to support the Malawi Ministry of Health and the private health sector in the delivery of high quality safe medical male circumcisions.</narrative>
  </description>
